        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Apartment 19, Laurel House, Carrickmines Green\r\n\r\n\r\nKW Team Castles are please to present new to the market a superb third-floor apartment ideally positioned in the sought-after Carrickmines Green development. Apartment 19 offers bright and well-proportioned accommodation, with the added benefit of a dedicated car parking space.\r\n\r\n\r\nFeaturing a 'B' Energy Rating and spanning approximately 48sqm, Apartment 19 is situated on the top floor, enjoying a wonderful elevated position with stunning views towards the Dublin and Wicklow Mountains, providing a peaceful and attractive outlook.\r\n\r\n\r\nPerfectly located for access to the M50, public transport, Dundrum, Sandyford and a wide range of local amenities, this apartment presents an excellent opportunity for first-time buyers, investors or those seeking a well-connected home in a desirable residential setting.\r\n\r\n\r\nViewing strictly by appointment only."
